# --- Claude Code local settings (per-machine, not shared) ---
# Local Claude Code tooling (settings, plugin bundle, agents, rules, MCP servers).
# Installed per-machine, not FORJD source. Un-ignore individually anything worth sharing —
# .mcp.json in particular is safe to commit if the team should share MCP configuration.
.claude/
.agents/
skills-lock.json
.mcp.json

# --- IDE ---
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.iml
*.swp

# --- OS ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Local data ---
/postgres-data/
/redis-data/

# Expo CLI scratch state. `apps/mobile/.gitignore` already covers the app itself; this
# catches the dirs the CLI drops in whatever workspace it happens to be invoked from.
.expo/

# InBody spike inputs: real report photos are personal health data.
# Only anonymized, committed golden fixtures belong in the repo (see docs/decisions/ADR-006).
scripts/spikes/inbody-samples/

# graphify knowledge-graph output. Fully derived from the repo and regenerable with
# `/graphify`, and the sidecars hardcode absolute machine-local paths (interpreter
# location, scan root, per-file cache keys) that are wrong on any other machine.
graphify-out/
